Revision history for RT-Extension-Public-Holidays

1.0.0  2026-04-25
        - Initial release
        - Login page holiday banner with flag emoji, type icons, and descriptions
        - TodaysHolidays dashboard widget, auto-registered via HomepageComponents
        - ~280 worldwide holidays from 100+ countries
        - Bootstrap 5 CSS variable theming (Elevator light/dark, KN theme)
        - Configurable CSV path via $HolidaysCSVPath
